(7637407, 1239166, 24454, '<td valign="top">Such an amazing bridge.  The perspective with the city behind it makes this so appealing.  My only nit-pick is how much more spectacular this would be if it had been taken just before sunset or after sunrise.  My theory in photography is that the most important piece of camera gear one should own is an alarm clock.  But even so, it''s a very nice image, and I''m voting it high.</td>', 'Such an amazing bridge.  The perspective with the city behind it makes this so appealing.  My only nit-pick is how much more spectacular this would be if it had been taken just before sunset or after sunrise.  My theory in photography is that the most important piece of camera gear one should own is an alarm clock.  But even so, it''s a very nice image, and I''m voting it high.', '2019-08-07 12:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7637408, 1239116, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really like this one! It has more of a lifestyle, journalistic look which makes the composition and scene just right!</td>', 'I really like this one! It has more of a lifestyle, journalistic look which makes the composition and scene just right!', '2019-08-07 12:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
