(7637546, 1239448, 114285, '<td valign="top">I was blown away when I first viewed this. Its truly sensational, the colours, the sharpness of the bridge yet softness of the water and sky. Was this all done in post production or mostly in camera? Would love to know. Anyway 10s are rarely given out by me these days but this surely deserves one, and a fave.<br/> <br/>Surely this is  the blue.</td>', 'I was blown away when I first viewed this. Its truly sensational, the colours, the sharpness of the bridge yet softness of the water and sky. Was this all done in post production or mostly in camera? Would love to know. Anyway 10s are rarely given out by me these days but this surely deserves one, and a fave. Surely this is  the blue.', '2019-08-08 10:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
